<title>USA: AMEX closes averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closes averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trading on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 579.60, up 1.13.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up two cents.</p>
<p>Breadth was slightly negative. Loser beat winners 283 to 271.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 16,874,580 compared with 18,353,165 on Monday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
